---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ButtonNav from '../components/ButtonNav.astro';

const sections = [
  { id: 'business', name: 'Business' },
  { id: 'about', name: 'About' },
  { id: 'partners', name: 'Partners' },
];
const tags = ['sanko', 'electronica', 'naval', 'embalajes', 'girocompas', 'mar del plata', 'autopiloto', 'radar', 'sonar','sq800', 'pesca', 'calamar'];
---

<Layout title="Sanko Electronica" description="Inicio Sanko Electronica" tags={tags}>
  <ButtonNav sections={sections} />
	<main>
    <section id="business">
        <!-- <div class="banner" > -->
        <nav>
          <a href="/hamade" class="nav-item">Hamade</a>
          <a href="/pesca-de-calamar" class="nav-item">Pesca de Calamar</a>
          <a href="/embalajes" class="nav-item">Embalajes</a>
          <a href="electronica-naval" class="nav-item">Electronica naval</a>
          <a href="girocompases-y-autopilotos" class="nav-item">Girocompases y autopilotos</a>
        </nav>
    </section>
    <section id="about">
      <div class="content">
        <h1>Sobre Nosotros</h1>
        <p class="glass">
     En Sanko Electrónica, con sede en Mar del Plata, trabajamos desde 1977 brindando soluciones integrales para la industria pesquera. Nos especializamos en la provisión de maquinaria, mantenimiento, reparación y repuestos para la pesca de calamar; máquinas sunchadoras; y la venta de girocompases, autopilotos y equipos de electrónica naval como sonares, radares y GPS. Representamos a marcas líderes japonesas reconocidas mundialmente por su calidad y confiabilidad, consolidándonos como referentes en el sector.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section id="partners">
      <div class="content">
        <h1>Quienes confian en nosotros</h1>
        <p class="glass">
Gracias a nuestra experiencia y tradición en el sector, en Sanko Electrónica contamos con una amplia base de clientes que confían en nuestros servicios y productos. Esto, a su vez, nos ha llevado a establecer relaciones sólidas con reconocidas marcas, que confían en nosotros para representarlas en el mercado.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style >
  .flags{
    display:flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }
  a{
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  #business {
    padding-block: unset;
    display: initial;
  }
  section{
    padding-block: unset;
    display: flex;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: white;
    background-color: var(--frame);
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .content p {
    padding: 4rem 2rem;
  }
  main {
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,110,240,0.3), rgba(256,0,0, 0.10)),
      /* url(https://images.locationscout.net/2019/06/banquina-de-pescadores-argentina.webp?h=1401&q=80); */
      url("../assets/images/barcos1.jpeg");
    background-size: cover;
    background-attachment: fixed;
  }
  section {
     padding-block: 100px
  }

  nav {
    display: grid;
    height: 100vh;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    transition: 500ms ease-in-out;
  }

nav:has(:nth-child(1):hover) {
  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
}

nav:has(:nth-child(2):hover) {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
}

nav:has(:nth-child(3):hover) {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 2fr 1fr 1fr;
}

nav:has(:nth-child(4):hover) {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 2fr 1fr;
}
nav:has(:nth-child(5):hover) {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 2fr;
}

.nav-item {
  position: relative;
  padding: 30px;
  height: 100vh;
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  text-decoration: none;
  color: #fff;
  background-size: cover;
  pointer-events: auto;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  text-shadow: 3px 3px 3px #000;
  z-index: 1;
}

.nav-item::after {
  position: absolute;
  z-index: -1;
  inset: 0;
  content: "";
  transition: opacity 0.3s ease-in-out;
  opacity: 0.5;
}

.nav-item:hover::after {
  opacity: 1;
}

.nav-item:nth-child(1)::after {
    background-color: rgba(0, 100, 250, 0.25);
}
.nav-item:nth-child(2)::after {
    background-color: rgba(250, 100, 100, 0.25);
}
.nav-item:nth-child(3)::after {
    background-color: rgba(180, 180, 10, 0.25);
}
.nav-item:nth-child(4)::after {
  background-color: rgba(10, 250, 180, 0.25);
}
.nav-item:nth-child(5)::after {
    background-color: rgba(100, 100, 250, 0.5);
}

.nav-item:nth-child(1) {
  background-image: url("https://www.mardelplata.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/img.jpg");
}
.nav-item:nth-child(2) {
  background-image: url("https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcREz2r1FRsZroUifmCmvwDz8yjjkPjV4sJLfA&s");
}
.nav-item:nth-child(3) {
  background-image: url("https://sym-naval.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/reparacion-naval.jpg");
}

.nav-item:nth-child(4) {
  background-image: url("https://assets.isu.pub/document-structure/230415154704-268967766751c96014e65ecdc9c5a61f/v1/3a5e70fd62fa4547182a427a9e0f1377.jpeg");
}

.nav-item:nth-child(5) {
  background-image: url("https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcREz2r1FRsZroUifmCmvwDz8yjjkPjV4sJLfA&s");
}

  /* Mobile */ 
 @media (max-width: 1345px) {
   .flags{
      display: none;
    }
    h1 {
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    h1 span {
      display: none;
    }
  } 
  @media (max-width: 1150px) { 
    h1{
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    } 
    .content p {
      padding: 2rem 1rem;
    }
    .nav-item {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
    }
    nav {
    width: 100vw ;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr ;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    }
    .nav-item {
      height: unset;
    }
   
    /* Desactivar hover manualmente en móviles */
    nav:has(:nth-child(1):hover),
    nav:has(:nth-child(2):hover),
    nav:has(:nth-child(3):hover),
    nav:has(:nth-child(4):hover),
    nav:has(:nth-child(5):hover) {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr ;
      /* grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; */
    }
  }
</style>
